@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR_T4
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 35

class ModelManager
class ActiveFilter
interface "Predicate<Person>" as Predicate
class PersonSelectionPredicate
class "SortedList<Person>" as Sorted <<JavaFX>>
class "FilteredList<Person>" as Filtered <<JavaFX>>
interface "ObservableList<Person>" as Records <<JavaFX>>

ModelManager --> "0..*" ActiveFilter : activeFilters
ModelManager --> "0..*" Predicate : additionalFilters
PersonSelectionPredicate ..|> Predicate
ActiveFilter --> "1" Predicate : predicate
ModelManager --> "1" Sorted : sortedPersons
ModelManager --> "1" Filtered : filteredPersons
Sorted --> "1" Filtered : source
Filtered --> "1" Records : source
note bottom of Records: Live, unmodifiable roster list from\nAddressBook.getPersonList(). Stored order is unchanged.
note top of Sorted: Exposed by getFilteredPersonList().\nComparator set by sort; cleared by list/import.
note top of ActiveFilter: Name, email and tag conditions.\nrefreshFilteredPersons() combines all conditions with AND.
note bottom of PersonSelectionPredicate: One type of additional predicate.\nSelected references follow record replacements.
@enduml
